                <pb facs="0454" n="448" sameAs="frus:frus1942v02/pg448"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/25663: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé at Tangier (Childs)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-11-20T00:00:00-04:00">November 20,
                            1942—midnight.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>239. Your 617, Nov. 14, noon. In as much as it is believed that Murphy had this
                    subject in mind, the Department suggests that you communicate your query to
                    him.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
